meta {
  name: Get Current User
  type: http
  seq: 21
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me?code={{functionKey}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Get Current User
  
  Retrieves the current authenticated user's profile information.
  
  ## Authentication
  Requires a valid JWT token in the Authorization header (Bearer token).
  
  ## Response Fields
  - `id` (guid): Internal user identifier
  - `externalIdObjectId` (string): Entra External ID object ID
  - `email` (string): User's email address
  - `displayName` (string): User's display name
  - `householdId` (guid, optional): ID of household the user belongs to
  - `householdName` (string, optional): Name of the household
  - `isAdmin` (bool): Whether the user is an admin of their household
  
  ## Error Responses
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Invalid or missing authentication token
  - `404 Not Found`: User not registered in the system
}
